; KICKSET on a lab (Team 6, 10 Nov 2026).
; The host script has already laid SYS:KsTest/Parts/KickstartSet (bodies for
; 62, 183 and 20) and two leftover drawers, 183 and 20. This runs the install.
; FailAt 21 so a warning does not stop LabAgent before the marker.
FailAt 21
Echo "--- kickset ---"
C:GFOpenUpTool KICKSET SYS:KsTest/Parts/KickstartSet
Echo "--- kickset done ---"
